s:
Discard 1 card, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Destroy 1 card on the field.
● Banish this card (until the End Phase), and if you do, Special Summon 1 LIGHT or DARK monster from your GY.

Target 1 "Guardian" monster in your GY that cannot be Normal Summoned/Set to activate 1 of these effects;
● Add it to your hand.
● Add 1 card mentioned on it from your GY to your hand.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Discard 1 WATER monster to the GY, then target 1 face-up monster your opponent controls; destroy it.
 ● Destroy 1 FIRE monster in your hand, then you can draw 1 card.

Pay 800 LP, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Special Summon this card as a Normal Monster (Zombie/LIGHT/Level 10/ATK 1500/DEF 2800) (this card is also still a Trap), then, if you control "Eldlich the Golden Lord", you can return 1 monster on the field to the hand.
● Set 1 of your banished "Golden Land" or "Eldlixir" Spells/Traps.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Detach 1 material from a monster you control, then add 1 Fish, Sea Serpent, or Aqua monster from your GY to your hand, except "LeVirtue Dragon".
 ● Target 2 Xyz Monsters on the field; attach 1 material from 1 of those monsters to the other.

Discard this card, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Add 1 "Magistus" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Spoon, the Seal of Magistus".
 ● Halve the ATK of 1 face-up monster your opponent controls until the end of this turn.

Activate the following effect depending on whose turn it is;
● Yours: Special Summon 1 "Gladiator Beast" monster from your Deck.
 ● Opponent's: Special Summon 1 Level 11 or lower "Gladiator Beast" monster from your Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Add 1 "Zubaba" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Zubababa Knight", and if you do, this card's Level becomes that added monster's.
 ● Destroy 1 Level 4 or lower Defense Position monster your opponent controls.

Target 2 "Goblin" monsters you control that have a Level, then activate 1 of these effects;
● The Level of 1 of them becomes the Level of the other.
● The Levels of both monsters become their combined original Levels.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon using this card you control.
 ● Immediately after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon using this card you control.

Pay 600 LP, then activate 1 of these effects;
● If you control monsters of each Level from 1 to 6: Choose 1 face-up monster your opponent controls that has a Level, and destroy all other monsters they control with an equal Level/Rank/Link Rating.
● Choose 1 face-up monster you control that has a Level, and destroy all your opponent's monsters in its column with an equal Level/Rank/Link Rating.

Activate 1 of these effects (but you can only use each effect of "Dark Contact" once per turn);
 ● Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck that must be Special Summoned with "Dark Fusion", by shuffling its materials from your field, GY, and/or banishment into the Deck. (This is treated as a Fusion Summon with "Dark Fusion".)
● Add 1 "Supreme King's Castle" or "Dark Fusion" from your Deck to your hand.

Pay 1500 LP and Tribute this card, then activate 1 of these effects;
● Destroy all face-up monsters your opponent controls.
 ● Destroy all face-up Spells/Traps your opponent controls.

Target 1 face-up card in the Field Zone, then activate this effect based on its controller;
● You: Destroy it, and if you do, add 1 Field Spell with a different name from your Deck to your hand.
● Your opponent: Negate its effects (until the end of this turn), and if you do, add 1 Field Spell from your Deck to your hand.

Detach 1 material from this card, then activate this effect depending on whose turn it is;
● Yours: Banish up to 1 card each from your opponent's field and GY.
● Opponent's: Look at your opponent's hand and banish 1 card from it face-up, until the End Phase.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Add 1 "Performage" Pendulum Monster from your Deck to your face-up Extra Deck.
 ● Destroy 1 "Performage" Monster Card you control.

Activate 1 of these effects;
● Equip 1 of those monsters to this card as an Equip Spell that gives it 500 ATK.
 ● Draw 1 card.
